cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset or code, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Thai e-commerce customer reviews of perfume and indigo-dyed products with opinion labels, and SG-HS workflow notebook"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-04
abstract: >-
  Two labelled datasets of Thai customer reviews collected from the Shopee and
  Lazada marketplaces: 4,656 perfume reviews and 3,279 reviews of indigo-dyed
  products, each labelled positive (1) or negative (0) by majority vote of three
  experts. The repository also contains a Google Colab notebook that classifies
  the reviews with Word2Vec embeddings (CBOW, Skip-gram, and Skip-gram with
  hierarchical softmax) and CNN, BiLSTM and RNN classifiers.
